window.products.push({"id":1155108,"name":"Manifestation Crystals Altar Tarot Cloth, Large 24 Inches x 24 Inches, Abundance Crystals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YWcu9HjwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Draw on all the abundance within yourself and amplify your intentions with our watercolor painted crystal cloth. Save yourself the money of over 100 crystals painted onto our Abundance cloth projecting your thoughts and tarot spread into the Universe. Our tarot cloth comes in a unique design unavailable for anyone else to manufacture. Click add to cart right now and order yours today. Design Thoughts: I’m a collector and my favorite thing to surround myself with is crystals. They’re beautiful and carry an amazing energy. That beautiful intensity is how I’d love to envelop all of my tarot spreads and this is the closest I could create to sharing that passion with the tarot community. I hope you love it. Fabric: Our cloth is made out of a plush 200 gsm short velvet fabric (100% polyester). The front is white velvet with the colored crystals (primarily green, orange, and red) border printed onto it. The back is also white, but a smoother poly backing. We’ve hemmed the edge to make sure it will last for your tarot reading journey. The cloth ships folded. Cleaning: You can spot clean it, but we did choose this fabric because it’s so easy to clean and is very durable. It does well in low heat and a cold wash. If you want to iron it, we suggest setting your iron to the lowest heat possible and to quickly run it across the back of the cloth. As with most fabrics, ironing it for too long will burn and ruin it. *Please note that the listing is for the cloth only. Any props used in the photos are to demonstrate how we’ve used the tarot cloth ourselves. Dreamt up and designed in Los Angeles, created in China","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YWcu9HjwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hidden Crystal Tarot","source_asin":"B07MXP1LQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MXP1LQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MXP1LQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
