window.products.push({"id":1155255,"name":"EVEN NATURALS Luxury Pop Up Mosquito Net Tent, Large: for Twin to King Size Bed, Extra Fine Holes, Canopy with Lace, Folding Design with Bottom, 2 Ent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oC3XlwRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"p> ‘Without the net, eaten alive, inside the net NO mosquitoes or any other insects!’ ‘Makes sitting outside more enjoyable knowing the bugs can’t get me!’ ‘Adds a touch of romance to the bedroom while keeping us from being eaten. Who wouldn’t love that?’ EVEN Naturals Mosquito Nets allow you to get a good night’s rest - insect free! Whether you are using the nets indoors or out, rest assured that the handcrafted, durable fabric will keep even the smallest bugs away giving you a more peaceful sleep. The multi-filament polyester fabric is REACH compliant, and not treated with DEET or any other chemical making it 100% eco-friendly. Each net is handcrafted and reinforced on the areas that typically receive the most wear, making it long lasting and more durable than any other net on the market. This EVEN Naturals Mosquito Net is the ideal size for covering 2 adults. Whether you are camping, looking for a protective layer for your children, or a way to add a touch of romance to the bedroom, EVEN Naturals has you covered. We include a carry bag for easy and convenient storage of your net, and a manual loaded with tips and tricks for using your net most effectively. Whether you are vacationing in the tropics, or looking for extra protection in your home or garden, the EVEN Naturals Mosquito Net helps you from being eaten alive. Order yours today, and experience the EVEN Naturals difference!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oC3XlwRzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVEN NATURALS","source_asin":"B07QJWTP2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QJWTP2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QJWTP2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
