window.products.push({"id":1155454,"name":"FIZZpod Soda Maker With TWO CO2 Cylinder- Fizzy Drink Machine with 3 PET Bottles, 3 Caps, 1 Carbonator Cap and Manual - Make Homemade Sparkle Water, J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sPEV16ImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥤ENJOY SPARKLING WATER AT HOME - With a sparkling water maker, you can easily make your own carbonated water at home. Whether you prefer to make seltzer water, soda water, or bubbly water, this machine makes it easy and convenient 🥤 VERSATILE SPARKLING WATER MACHINE: The Fizzpod soda maker uses patented technology and features a 2-step gas relief and split injection pipe, which makes it possible to use it for any beverage. You can even add fruits for a delicious, fruity twist FIZZpod soda make uses a 2-step gas relief and split injection pipe that makes it possible to use it for any beverage--you can even add fruits! 🥤 INCLUDES TWO 60L CO2 CYLINDER: The FIZZPod includes TWO CO2 cylinder to start creating your first sparkled water drink right away! The FIZZPod soda maker includes 1 Carbonator, 2 CO2 Cylinder (60L), 3 PET Bottles, 3 Caps, 1 Fizz Infuser and a manual. 🥤MODERN DESIGN - The Fizzpod is a sleek and lightweight soda maker that is perfect for any home. It's a great addition to your kitchen or bar. lightful piece to have. The carbonator’s Cylinder Screw also allows you to attach and take off the bottle without hassle 🥤 GREAT GIFT IDEA - The Fizzpod soda maker makes a great gift for anyone who loves fizzy drinks. Give the gift of health and convenience with this water carbonator machine. 🥤 VARIETY OF BEVERAGES - The sparkling water machine is not limited to just water. You can carbonate other beverages like juices, cocktails, wine, and even flat beer. With the Fizzpod, you can make a variety of fun and tasty drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sPEV16ImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DRINKPOD","source_asin":"B086D17946","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086D17946","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086D17946","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
