window.products.push({"id":1155471,"name":"Large Picture Frames Clear Glass 5x7 Photo Vertical or Horizontal Table Top Modern Traditional Home or Office Decor Wedding Anniversary Family Graduat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ipXwLBYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This J Devlin picture frame is designed using narrow pieces of clear flute textured glass with a simple metal border. Clean vertical and horizontal lines are unexpected yet sophisticated. Modern mixed with traditional it will compliment any home or office décor. This 5x7 table top picture frame has an easel back allowing it to be used horizontal or vertically. A style both men and women will love. Add a cherished photo and this frame will make the ideal keepsake gift for a baby, graduation or wedding anniversary. A gift for a someone special or as an addition to your own home décor. Coordinating pieces and additional sizes are available and look stunning paired together. Each picture frame is carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans using a copper foil and solder technique developed by Louis Comfort Tiffany in the late 1800’s. This age-old art form combined with 21st century designs creates the perfect combination for unique home décor. All designs are J Devlin originals…enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ipXwLBYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Devlin Glass Art","source_asin":"B01IPWJSTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IPWJSTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IPWJSTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
