window.products.push({"id":1155511,"name":"ENKORE Absorbent Coasters for Drinks, Set of 6 Extra Large 4.3\" Ceramic Cup Mats in Gray Line Design, Thirsty Clay Stone Pack with Cork Base Pad Prote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KMHHUlZ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE SIZE - 4.3 INCH (11cm) IN DIAMETER, bigger than most coasters on the market (common size is barely 4 inch). This means our coasters suit all types of drinking glasses such as bourbon, highball, lowball, whiskey glasses, coffee mugs, tumblers, flasks, Mason jars, and large fountain drinks. With these larger than standard costers you can prevent spillage onto your furniture and countertops. They also make excellent holders for bar tools and wine accessories HIGHLY MOISTURE ABSORBING - It means you will never have a puddle of water left behind and the coasters don't stick or cling to the glass when they're wet like they do with other coasters. You and your guests can enjoy party without worrying about excess condensation from cold beverages, Whiskey, Cocktail, beer... Isn't it assuring when put a glass of icy water on your wooden side table or nightstand on a hot summer night knowing they won’t leave a moisture ring on your furniture and damage it? MODERN LOOKING, DECORATIVE & ATTRACTIVE GRAY LINES DESIGN - This tableware is constructed with decorative transfer print. They can be used as home & office decor, barware set, bar service mat, bartender supplies or table pad. The cork mat on the back makes the coasters stay put without sacrificing their appearance. CLASSY GIFT – A great housewarming, birthday, or holiday gift for anyone young or old. Present for mom, dad, him, her, man and woman. Conversation starter for the host at any entertaining event or wedding registry. CLEANING INSTRUCTION - PLEASE BE AWARE that these coasters stain more easily than other ENKORE ceramic coasters that have darker colors.This is mainly due to the white base color of these coasters. They are excellent in absorbing fluid drips from cold drinks but vulnerable to coffee & tea spill. We recommend you to buy ENKORE Mandala coaster if you need coasters for coffee or tea. To clean these white coasters, soak coaster in 1 part household bleach and 3 parts water until stain lifts. Air dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KMHHUlZ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enkore","source_asin":"B08ZL7LJ79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZL7LJ79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZL7LJ79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
