window.products.push({"id":1155544,"name":"Wood Stove Fan, 6-Blade Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered, with Magnetic Thermometer, Non Electric Fireplace Fan for Wood/Log Burner, Wood Stove Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715G4pG6yrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥[2022 New 6-Blades Wood Burner Fans]: Compared with the old stove fan last year, we have upgraded the stove fan blade and motor of this fan, So the effective working range of the stove fan can reach 3 meters, which is twice that of other fans. It can more effectively accelerate the circulation of hot air in the room, widely used in wood stoves, gas stoves, log burners, fireplaces, etc. in winter. 🔥[Energy Saving and Environmental Friendly]: The stove fan uses thermal power to work, and no batteries or electricity required. It can absorb the high temperature on the fireplace surface and convert it into rotary power, so as to drive the hot air circulation of the whole room, instead of allowing the hot air to gather on the top of the room. 🔥[Mute work]: The top of the fan is equipped with a temperature display strip, stove fan operates automatically when the surface temp of the stove reaches 158-230 degrees Fahrenheit(depending on the type of fireplace), The newly upgraded motor makes the sound of the wood stove fan less than 30db even at the highest speed, you hardly hear anything, allowing you to enjoy a warm and quiet winter. 🔥[Simple operation and Excellent material]: No installation is required, just place the stove fan on the smooth surface of the furnace top, and the stove fan will start to rotate as the fireplace temperature rises.Wood Burner Fans Made of anodized aluminum with good thermal conductivity, the blade thickness is upgraded to 1.2mm, it will not deform or rust even if it works for a long time at high temperature 🔥[Gifts and After Sales]: We will give you an extra thermometer and anti scald gloves to protect your safety. In addition, we provide warranty service for 60 day, and our after-sales team will serve you wholeheartedly.(According to your comments, Amazon does not provide access to your order details, and we have no opportunity to contact you to solve your problem. If you need any help, please email me.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715G4pG6yrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AmzWorld","source_asin":"B0B5Q7W9TY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Q7W9TY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Q7W9TY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155545,"name":"POWEART Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 26Kpa Powerful Stick Vacuum Cleaner Cordless, 350W Self-Standing Lightweight 6-in-1 Vacuum Cleaner with Rechargeable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SMrcB1TZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Powerful Suction & Deep Cleaning】With a 350W super-strong advanced brushless motor, the cordless vacuum cleaners generate up to 26000Pa powerful suction while remaining in a relatively silent environment. Designed with two suction modes to meet a variety of cleaning needs: on standard mode, the cordless vacuum performs well on tile, marble, and wood floors, while in Max Power mode, the stick vacuum is able to effectively clean short pile carpets, pet hair, and larger particles like cereal, cat litter, and dust. 【6-in-1 Versatile Handheld Vacuum】Featuring a retractable tube and 3 useful attachments, including a main floor brush head, a 2-in-1 brush, and a crevice tool, the cordless stick vacuum cleaner is perfect for multi-task cleaning. When a stick vacuum is converted to a handheld vacuum with the 2-in-1 brush or crevice tool, it is suitable for clean places like stairs, shelves, sofas, and cars. With its extendable tube and multiple attachments, you can easily vacuum curtains, ceilings, and high surfaces. An easy-to-use stick cordless vacuum for deep & quick cleaning from floor to ceiling！ 【5-Stage High-efficiency Filtration System】With a 5-stage high-efficiency filtering system, the lightweight cordless vacuum captures and traps 99.99% of dust as small as 0.1 microns, keeping your home clean and healthy. A washable strainer and reusable HEPA of pet vacuum can filter dust and dirt efficiently, protecting the motor and ensuring the vacuum works properly. The high-density HEPA filter filtration performance is 200% more efficient than cotton filters and can last for a longer period of time. (An extra HEPA is included.) 【Long-lasting Runtime & Detachable Battery】Powered by an advanced 8-cell battery, this rechargeable vacuum has a 2200mA-h battery capacity, which supports 45 min max runtime on Standard mode and 20 min max on High speed. A full charge only takes about 4.5 hours, and the detachable feature allows for two charging options - while in the vacuum or separately. The spare pack can be prepared in advance, which is very convenient and time-saving. 【Flexible LED Motorized Floor Head】Battery stick vacuums feature LED motorized floor heads with beater rollers. There are both soft and stiff bristles on the roller, which can spin quickly to sweep up dirt from a variety of floors without scratching them. LED lights at the front help track dirt in dark and difficult-to-reach places. Cleaning underneath furniture like beds, tables, etc. becomes much easier when the floor vacuum head can be rotated 90° vertically and 150° horizontally. Due to the smooth rubber wheels on the bottom of a vacuum cleaner, the motorized brush head moves freely over hardwood floors, tile, marble floors, and low-pile carpets without leaving any marks. 【Easy to Use & Self-standing Storage】You will also save time and effort by using the self-standing cordless vacuum cleaner. The 1L dust bin is enough for a good amount of garbage, and it can be easily emptied with just one press. Lightweight hardfloor vacuum with storage wall mount and cleaning gadget. More surprise waiting you to find! Poweart V80 wireless quiet vacuum can be your perfect clea-ning partner!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SMrcB1TZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POWEART","source_asin":"B0BJ2QKR2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ2QKR2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ2QKR2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
