window.products.push({"id":1155579,"name":"Stainless Steel Lunch Box for Toddlers Girls-Thermal Leakproof Bento Box 3-Compartment double-deck Ideal Portion Sizes for Ages 1 to 3, Pre-School Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pslHXblYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🔹THERMAL TECHNOLOGY – The built-in water injection feature makes it easy to heat or cool. Simply add hot or cold water into the bottom basin before breakfast, lunch, or dinner！The bottom bowl is made of food grade PP and can also be used to hold fruits or salads. The lunch box itself does not have a long-term heat preservation effect, it needs to be added with hot water to achieve heat preservation, and the heat preservation time is about 1 hour. 🔹 EXCLUSIVE cat cartoon bule lunch box designed for 1 to 3 years– This adorable little lunch box for kids features a fun, bright double-deck design. A wonderful way for kids to tell their lunch box apart and remind them that they’re special. 🔹 Compact ECO-FRIENDLY Control – The three individual metal sections makes it easier to monitor how much your child is eating, expand the variety of their lunch options, and helps you maintain more positive control over their growing appetite. 🔹 Heavy-Duty LEAKPROOF INSULATED Container – Along with a sturdy leakproof design and easy-open latches for small hands these bento boxes for kids lunches are insulated in both the lid and box to help maintain temperature. Easily wash by hand for versatile food prep and quick clean up. In order to avoid leakage，pls do not tilt or turn the lunch box upside down after adding water to the bottom of the basin. 🔹 316L Stainless Steel + PP Kid's Bento Box – A fun way to send toddlers and young children to daycare, preschool or kindergarten with a healthy lunch this travel-friendly lunch box features 3 stainless steel sections sealed individually to let you pack fresh fruit, vegetables, mini sandwiches, wraps, snacks, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pslHXblYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUNCHMO","source_asin":"B091FF5D33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091FF5D33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091FF5D33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
