window.products.push({"id":1155633,"name":"Katherine's Collection 2022 Mistletoe Magic Tabletop Tree, 24.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":156.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+EyfHmVQL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"PREMIER ARTISTRY. Every signature piece is developed in the design studios in northeast Ohio. In the age of 3D printing and automation, handcrafted pieces of superior quality have become increasingly rare. That is why the company is so committed to hiring the most talented artists in the industry. The design team has extensive skills that include pattern making, sculpting, painting, and illustrating. NATURE-INSPIRED. The Katherine's Collection Mistletoe Magic collection pays tribute to the humble mistletoe which has always been a part of traditional holiday decor. The mistletoe takes center stage and is not just an ornament for people to kiss under. Design elements inspired by the plant can be seen throughout the collection. HOLIDAY TRADITION. The Mistletoe Magic Tabletop Tree measures 4.75 x 4.75 x 24.5 inches. The design features a miniature conical tree with a gold top and base. This piece highlights the mistletoe through the use of sequins, embroidery, and appliques. A stunning holiday display for your mantel, coffee table, desk, or shelf. The perfect accent to complete your home or office Christmas decor. LOVELY GIFT. If you're looking for a beautiful and special gift for a loved one, choose any piece from Katherine's Collection. They make wonderful wedding presents, housewarming tokens, or a gift for your colleague or boss. Make birthdays, Mother's Day, and other occasions a memorable one through the wide range of functional and decorative pieces. FROM HUMBLE BEGINNINGS. For 30 years, Katherine’s Collection has always been dedicated to creating a broad range of original, top-quality products each year. The company prides itself on delighting their collectors around the world with original character dolls, handcrafted creations, and holiday decor. Their artisanal approach has not stopped them from becoming an internationally requested brand and leader in the holiday decor industry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+EyfHmVQL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Katherine's Collection","source_asin":"B09QH7V6HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QH7V6HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QH7V6HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
