window.products.push({"id":1155695,"name":"LEMONDA Vintage Industrial Narrow Side Table, 3 Tier Slim End Table with Storage for Small Spaces, Living Room, Entryway,Nightstands for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613jQuy5MqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"<p>Large Storage Capacity: The 3-tier design of coffee stand gives you plenty of storage room, with 2 table surfaces and 1 mesh style shelf. It can hold your coffee cups, books, photo frames, magazines, laptop, and even microwaves. Size L(LxWxH): 51x23x61 cm / 20x9x24 inch, Size S(LxWxH): 46x28x61 cm / 18x11x24 inch.</p> <p>Solid & Sturdy Construction: Compact space saving end table is made of smooth wear-resistant particleboard, with scratchproof surface which is easy to clean by a wet cloth. 4 metal frame legs ensure great stability. Vertical bars on both sides prevent things from falling down.</p> <p>Attractive Appearance: Premium wooden board in rustic brown color combines with black metal frame, which is a trendy furniture with retro and modern look. Adds sense of vintage beauty to your home, blends well into any environment and background setting.</p> <p>Handy and Practical: This side table has 3 layers to store your variety of items. You can use it as a couch mate or a coffee table, bedside table, or just a simple storage rack in your living room, office, bedroom or kitchen. Whenever and wherever you need a storage shelf, it can get the job done.</p> <p>Easy to Assemble: Multifunctional furniture often has complex structures but this is not Lemonda. We have simplified each assembly step and if you follow the detailed instructions in the package, you will get the job done in no time.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613jQuy5MqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEMONDA","source_asin":"B08YQG7B78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YQG7B78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YQG7B78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155696,"name":"Nespresso C50-US-TP-NE Espresso Maker, Pure Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zWpFdRwYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"U, the ultimate machine in modularity, simplicity and purity. Combining personalization with an ultra-chic aesthetic, U is the perfect machine to create an Espresso in the comfort of your own home. U has been designed to fit modern life and its demands, offering ultra-convenient, yet sophisticated technology. U's first of its kind design allows you to rotate the water tank 180-Degree around the machine to suit you and your unique lifestyle and living space, while its cutting edge technology delivers a perfect coffee, time after time. Not only does U memorize the preferred cup size, but the machine's brewing unit will automatically release the capsule when it's done. A pleasure to use and display, U is the machine for those who seek ultimate simplicity, the highest quality coffee and pure design. Nespresso began more than 25 years ago with a simple but revolutionary idea, to create the perfect cup of Espresso coffee with exquisite crema, tantalizing aroma and full bodied taste-just like skilled Baristas. As the worldwide pioneer, Nespresso redefined the way coffee lovers around the world enjoy their espresso coffee through a unique combination of premium quality Grand Cru coffees, stylish coffee machines and exceptional customer service. To obtain the perfect espresso, Nespresso Experts seek out only the ﬁnest Grands Crus green coffees, which promise to offer the most tantalizing aromas. You can, depending on the variety of different recipes, enjoy Nespresso with milk. When combined with creamy milk foam, you will experience a whole new variety of flavors. The Nespresso Club Services. The Nespresso Club is always there for you, online, by telephone or in one of our Boutiques. Order your Nespresso capsules, receive personalized advice and obtain technical support for your machine: whatever you are seeking, the Nespresso Club and its Specialists are with you every step of the way. Benefit from quick and easy ordering whenever, wherever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zWpFdRwYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nespresso","source_asin":"B008U8Z126","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008U8Z126","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008U8Z126","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
