window.products.push({"id":1155711,"name":"Decopus Peel and Stick Metal Subway Tile (Aluminum Brushed Grain) Kitchen Backsplash Wall Accent 3\" x 6\" 40cps, SWT-Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ortVN6dpL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Decopus Self-adhesive Metal Tile, made of Aluminium Composite, which has been using for interior decoration for over 20 years. It allows you to self-match a high class, profession look interior wall for less. Decopus specialized 10+ years in wall decoration, and cabinet decoration. Product Features: Fashioned High-Class Feel & Touch Its metallic surface and dedicated finishes: horizontal brush, snowflake drops, circular polish adds a luxury touch to your wall. Its natural metal color: silver, reddish bronze, yellowish copper, gray chrome..., harmonizes with other room accents and wallpapers. Widely Used in DIY Decoration This aluminum tile is used widely for house decoration: kitchen backsplash, bathroom, wall accent, cabinet doors. Its standard and cut-size, easy cutting, drilling, and fixing allow everyone to make up his own wall pattern, self-matching design, and complete in hours. Simply \"Peel & Stick\" on any Clean and Smooth Surface Simply peel off the backing stickers then stick it on any clean, flat smooth surface with NO wet glue, NON-cement. Cutting as easy as a thin plywood, with NO heavy tools. So you can save your time and money on labor. Glue is strong and long-lasting. Easy to Clean, Safe and Durable The REAL aluminum promise no color fading, anti-scratch and splash.  On its metal surface, grease can be just wipe-n-clean easily. The Aluminium composite is fire retardant and waterproof. Cutting and Installation Easy to cut tiles, don't require spacers or grout. Tiles bend to create perfect corners with less cutting and no wasted offcuts. If there is a need to cut to fit in, use a utility knife, just following the seam between the individual pieces. But if you need to cut through the pieces, please use the: - Jigsaw or chop saw (recommended) - Hacksaw - Hole saw or coping saw","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ortVN6dpL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decopus","source_asin":"B07HDZ1WRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HDZ1WRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HDZ1WRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155712,"name":"Kich 14 Piece Iridescent Rainbow Stainless Steel Measuring Cups and Spoons Set Magnetic Metal Kitchen Conversion Chart Included Large Small and Mini S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D74Tu8nRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Only the best At KichBits, we seamlessly merge cutting edge measuring scoops with premium design principles. Each stainless steel measuring cups and spoons set is crafted to meet the highest standards that thousands of KichBits customers have come to expect from us. With 304 food grade stainless steel that is dishwasher safe, this set of thirteen iridescent stainless steel measuring cups and spoons are second to none. Each one of our metal measuring cups and spoons is rigorously examined before they leave the factory. If our rainbow metal spoons and measuring cup set doesn’t meet the highest standards, then we don’t sell it, simple as that! How our spoons measure up Here’s what’s included with our metal measuring spoons set: 1 (TBSP) 1/2 (TBSP) 1 (tsp) 1/2 (tsp) 1/4 (tsp) 1/8 (tsp) How our cups stack up Our stackable metal measuring cups come in seven sizes: 1 CUP 2/3 CUP 3/4 CUP 1/2 CUP 1/3 CUP 1/4 CUP 1/8 CUP Engraved measurements Our stainless steel measuring spoons and cups feature the volume engraved on the metal surface. No more guesswork or labels that rub off, just premium measuring cups and spoons from KichBits. Conversion chart included Say goodbye to the headache of guesswork. We’ve included an indestructible metal measuring conversion chart that lets you easily master your spoon and cup measure set. Best of all, it’s magnetic. Calculate like a masterchef with our chart and get the perfect portion every time. The KichBits promise If you don’t love your stainless measuring spoons and measuring cups, simply let us know what the issue is with your measuring cups and spoons and we’ll do whatever we can to make things right. No fuss, no tricks, no fine print; just incredible customer service from KichBits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D74Tu8nRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kich","source_asin":"B095PXYLQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095PXYLQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095PXYLQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
