window.products.push({"id":1155788,"name":"HOMI CHEF Mirror Polished NICKEL FREE Stainless Steel 1 QT(Quart) Sauce Pan with Lid (No Toxic Non Stick Coating, 5.5 Inch) - Mini Saucepan Cookware -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519qoAW+8dS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"MIRROR POLISHED & ELEGANT CUT - This mirror polished 1 QT sauce pan is noble and elegant; cuts a fine figure both in the kitchen and at the dining table - See-through tempered glass lid circulates heat & moisture - 3-ply construction in the base for optimal heat conduction - Great for cooking vegetables, melting butter, simmering sauces, soups or gravies - Petite in size, gives special attention to single servings - Discover the gourmet chef in you with this beautiful sauce pan. NICKEL FREE HARM FREE - Nickel-bearing stainless steel, such as 304SS (Cr/Ni: 18/8), being more corrosion-resistant, is commonly used in industry, BUT nickel is high up on the ATSDR list of priority toxins, and nickel LEACHES under regular cooking conditions. - This pan is made of food grade nickel free stainless steel: JYH21CT (21/0) for the inside layer and 430SS (18/0) for the outside layer. NICKEL FREE is also more heat-conductive. Tests show a noticeable degree (12-15%) of energy savings. NO COATING NO RISK - General non-stick coating cookware releases toxic fumes when cooking; is known to cause cancer and disrupt immune system. As it becomes worn, the risk of ingesting Teflon increases drastically. Our stainless steel sauce pan does not apply any coating, and is free of health hazard. 3-Ply construction the base & heat surround features allow for even heat conductivity and distribution to eliminate hot spots; thus achieve natural stick resistance without toxic PFOA and PTFE. ADDITIONAL FEATURES - 4MM thick 3-Ply construction in the base (one layer of pure aluminum core sandwiched between two stainless steel layers) ensures optimal thermal distribution and storage, thus faster cooking, better nutrition, and more energy savings - Solid stainless steel riveted stick handle features air-flow technology to help stay cool on the stovetop - Flared rims ensure drip free pouring - Compatible with gas, induction, ceramic and halogen stovetops; Oven & Dishwasher safe. DEVOTED CUSTOMER SERVICE - Genuine HOMICHEF stainless steel cookware products, certified by ISO9001, BSCI, etc. - TRADEMARK filed in U.S.A. - In business since 1998 - This product comes with 1-MONTH full refund trial period & LIFE-TIME Customer Service - You can always come to us for discounted parts, cooking consultations, and customer service at HOMICHEF store on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519qoAW+8dS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B074P46WXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074P46WXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074P46WXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
