window.products.push({"id":1155802,"name":"GoGice Round Ice Cube Tray Ice Maker Mold Ice Ball for Freezer with Container & Lid, Making 99 Pieces Ice Balls for Chilling Coffee Cocktail Tea & Bev","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c55RLfCKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Use: The Round Ice Cube Trays Are Made of Hard Plastic. Just Fill Water into The Trays and Close the Lid, Put Them into The Freezer Compartment, Wait for About 5 Hours, Take The Trays Out and Wait for About 1-3 Minutes, Then Twist The Trays a Few Times and Take Off The Lid, Then You Will Get 99 Pieces Round Ice Balls. Widely Applicable:You Can Use The Round Ice Balls to Cool Your Tea, Coffee, Whisky, Cocktail, Carbonated Beverage. You Can Also Use The Ice Balls for Food Refrigeration and Fresh Keeping. You Can Also DIY, Put Fruits Like Water Melon, Orange, Grape, Chocolate and Milk into The Tray Round Holes to Make Colorful Ice Balls. Safe Material: This Round Ice Cube Tray is Made of Food Grade Plastic Material, BPA FREE and ODOR Free, Temperature Safe Range is From -20℃ to 80℃. The PP Container's Temperature Safe Range is From -30℃ to 140℃, Suitable for Microwave. Also You Can Use it to Place Food In, Like Meat, Fruits, Vegetables, Beverage, and More. What's In Package: 3*Ice Cube Trays, Total 3 Trays With Each Contains 33 Pieces Round Holes; 1*Ice Ball Container, The Ice Ball Container With Its Size 10inch*7inch*3.7inch, Can Hold More Than 200 Pieces Round Ice Balls. 1* Ice Clip, Made of Stainless Steel, 15.5cm Long, Use Which to Take Ice Ball Out of The Tray. Sence of Accomplishment: You Can Get the Best Tasting and Looking Ice Once You Learn The Right Way to Use This Ice Cube Tray. The Best Thing About Using a Tray to Make Your Own Ice is That You Can Experiment With Different Liquids Other Than Water to Keep All of Your Drinks Cold Without Watering Them Down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c55RLfCKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoGice","source_asin":"B0BCZSNZ5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCZSNZ5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCZSNZ5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
