window.products.push({"id":1155822,"name":"Blackcell Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser and Tooth Brush Holder Set (while)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31otqE7OqGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Application Method of Toothpaste Dispenser: Choose the position for pasting and disclose the double side adhesive in the back to fix the toothpaste dispenser (It is suggested that the position is at the height of the user. Before pasting, get rid of water and other impurities) Remove the cover, and insert the toothpaste into the suction valve with force. (The toothpaste is liable to leak in the first tryout) When insert the used toothpaste, first squeeze out the air remained in the toothpaste nutil the bottom part, and then insert the toothpaste into the suction valve. Put the toothpaste in and press the button several times until the toothpaste has been squeezed out Cover the toothpaste after using The volume of the squeezed toothpaste depends on the viscosity of different toothpastes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31otqE7OqGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blackcell","source_asin":"B00USOCDLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00USOCDLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00USOCDLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155823,"name":"Amici Carnegie Collection Centerpiece Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PdeCgKn5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In need of a centerpiece that is ideal for entertaining? Look no further than the Amici Carnegie Collection Centerpiece. This vibrant copper-plated bowl boasts a fun, ribbed pattern to delight any setting. This beautiful piece is simply gorgeous doubling as a serving bowl or as centerpiece holding floating candles, scented candles, scented water, relaxing waterscapes, stones and so much more. Measuring 16.5\"D x 2.75\"H this centerpiece is perfect for everyday use or for any party, social event or gathering. The entire elegantly textured Amici Carnegie Collection is made in India and is composed of two other equally timeless pieces. Check out the whole collection which also includes a serving tray and serving bowl. Perfect for entertaining, this collection can accommodate any need or complement any decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PdeCgKn5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amici Home","source_asin":"B010HE0JU4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010HE0JU4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010HE0JU4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155824,"name":"Department 56 Snow Village Let's Go To The Moon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513toFdEQEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Department 56 Original Snow Village LET'S GO TO THE MOON Wonderfully handcrafted of high-quality ceramic, capturing a wealth of intricate details. From the Department 56 Halloween Village Series Arrives in an Original Snow Village Halloween box 4.75 x","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513toFdEQEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00266OMY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00266OMY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00266OMY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155825,"name":"AVLA Ceramic Airtight Jar, 24 FL OZ Porcelain Food Storage Canister with Acacia Wood Lid, Kitchen Containers for Serving Loose Tea, Coffee, Sugar, Nut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sjDz+igBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size and Capacity: AVLA ceramic container measures 4.1\" ( L ) x 4.1\" ( W ) x 6\" H ( Include Lid ), approx: 24 FL OZ ( Normal Capacity ). Perfect for storing and preserving a variety of ingredients including preserves, jams, herbs, nuts, sugar, flour, tea, coffee, spices, biscuits, etc. Unique Design: The bottom of our storage containers fits well with the lid and can be stacked easily, saving you some space in your kitchen.With the smooth appearance and simple design can match your cabinet, highlighting the elegant and modern style. Grade Porcelain Material: Ceramic food storage jar is made of porcelain, lead-free, and lightproof. The containers with wooden lid and rubber seal to ensure a true airtight seal and lightproof. No worry for rust or too fragile, unlike steel or glass. Easy to Clean and Store: Wide opening and easy to clean. Nonstick and smooth glaze resists sticking or flaking, easy to clean with dishwasher or hand wash with soap and water. Oven, microwave and refrigerator safe. Lids are hand wash only. Warm Reminder: When covered with the lid, then use the way of pressing turn the lid that could make tea canister more tightly sealed through the silicone ring. If you can't close the lid properly, you can drill the hole in the sealing ring bigger so that it will be easier to close.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sjDz+igBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVLA","source_asin":"B09716N6YH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09716N6YH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09716N6YH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155826,"name":"Bialetti - Mini Express Color: Moka Set includes Coffee Maker 2-Cup (2.8 Oz) + 2 shot glasses, Red, Aluminium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U1+hEV3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The stylish and innovation of ready Coffee Maker: Mini Express is the ultimate combination of creativity and innovation: The original Mini Express: Experience the Italian way of preparing a tasteful coffee with Bialetti Mini Express, with its unique innovative design and long-lasting materials. The historic gentleman with the moustache on its front is a guarantee of the originality and quality of a Bialetti product. The easiest way to prepare coffee: Fill the boiler up to the safety valve, put the filter back in place and fill it up with ground coffee without pressing. Close the Mini Express pot firmly and place it on the stove at medium temperature. The innovative dispensig allows the coffee to be served directly in the cups which are kept warm thanks to the special aluminum support plate The right number of espresso cups: Musa sizes are measured in Espresso Cups. Coffee can be enjoyed in Espresso two Cups included. Bialetti Mini Express pot is suitable for gas, and electric cooktops, as well as propane camping stoves. Cleaning instructions: Simply wash with water, your Bialetti Mini Express must only be cleaned by rinsing every component with simple water. Do not use any detergent nor put it in the dishwasher, as it damages the product and the taste of your coffee. The quintessence of italy As soon as someone comes to visit, the first thing they will be asked when entering an Italian home is whether they would like a cup of coffee. To be able to offer a perfect Italian is a full multisensorial experience, beyond the taste of coffee: its gurgling is a relaxing musical sound, and the intense aroma you can smell all over the kitchen will soon become your favorite scent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U1+hEV3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B0842XDFG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842XDFG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842XDFG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155827,"name":"Ovente Multi-Purpose Immersion Hand Blender Set – 300-Watts, 2-Speed – Stainless Steel Blades and Detachable Shaft – Includes Egg Whisk and BPA-Free B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a7oWOaXhL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","description":"Witness ease, convenience, and versatility at work—right in your own kitchen. Discover a world of innovative cooking possibilities with the Ovente HS580 Handheld Immersion Blender. It makes blending and mixing any soft foods a pleasure because it makes it SO easy and effortless, that’s actually fun! Its lightweight body along with its ergonomically-designed, non-slip handle is so comfortable to hold and control that cooking won’t ever feel like a chore again. Whip up all of your favorite gourmet soups, guacamole, smoothies/shakes, cake batter, salsas, sauces, marinades, salad dressings, or even homemade baby food for your precious bundle of joy with just one press of a button . This set also comes with BPA-Free and dishwasher-safe attachments: a stainless steel mixing stick, a stainless steel egg whisk, and a heavy-duty Tritan beaker (24oz) with cup measurements. These attachments are all super versatile, useful, convenient in the kitchen and help you to create endless cooking/blending possibilities even better and quicker than before! Powered by 300-Watts and a heavy-duty motor , it works quickly and effectively—expertly mixing anything you desire into a smooth, evenly-mixed medley of mouth-watering flavors. Its Slim-Stick design enables this hand blender to fit into any mixing bowl, pot, beaker, or cookware without restriction. It also comes with a long cord (4.5 feet) . It’s compact enough to fit anywhere, but powerful enough for the toughest blending jobs. It was also carefully designed to come apart easily so that clean up and storage is no problem . Simply take apart, then hand wash the shaft or place into the dishwasher and let dry. The body can simply be wiped clean with a soft, damp cloth. NOTE: TO PREVENT OVERHEATING, OPERATE THE HAND BLENDER IN ONE MINUTE INTERVALS OR LESS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a7oWOaXhL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B075KMF7M9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075KMF7M9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075KMF7M9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155828,"name":"Valentine's Day Shower Curtain, Funny Gnomes Red Truck Floral Shower Curtain Set, Farmhouse Gnome Valentine Bathroom Decor, Waterproof Fabric Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k-2J3+EJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"If you're taking a shower, you'll need a shower curtain to keep water from splashing，Our Valentines shower curtain with gnomes and red truck designs allows you to decorate your bathroom and keep it dry without spending a lot of money. The Valentine shower curtains we produce are very stylish and durable. Excellent graphic design and quality will make your shower experience better.These Valentine gnome shower curtains are also very practical. Our Valentine shower curtains for bathroom are made of polyester fabric, which makes them waterproof and easy to maintain. You can wash them by machine or hand in cold water.We also have other sizes to choose：Small/Stall Valentines Day shower curtain 47”X64” fit for Camper/RV, 36”X72” fit for small bathroom decor, gnome Valentine shower curtain 72”X72” fit for hotel, dorm room, school shower.Kind tips:The Valentine gnome shower curtains may have a little color difference because of the monitor or the light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k-2J3+EJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lacoiime","source_asin":"B09L7NVZ64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L7NVZ64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L7NVZ64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155829,"name":"Ottomanson Vinyl Tablecloth Retro Kitchen Design Indoor & Outdoor Non-Woven Backing Tablecloth, 55\" X 70\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eu0OUhI+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduce a whimsical note on your kitchen table, dinner space, patio, porch and picnic tables with our charming retro kitchen design tablecloth depicting free-spirited retro images of all sort of cutely-printed kitchen items like cups, spoons, forks and pans in multicolor hues to create a stylish contemporary foundation for every meal as well as visual appeal. Available in a rich assortment of sizes and shapes for an ideal fit to your space, this multi-purpose tablecloth is great for Thanksgiving Gatherings, Christmas Holiday, New Years Dining, Parties, Babyshowers, Picnics, Happy hours, Potlucks, Barbecues, Camping, Trips, Restaurants, Cafeterias and Caterings. Suitable for everyday usage as well as indoor and outdoor dining activities, this practical yet attractive piece will add extra joy and touch of delight to the taste of your meals and fun times. With large scope of application, these lovely and budget-friendly tablecloths also make great gifts for birthdays, holidays and new homebuyer visits. Durable and super easy to clean with minimal effort, this cozy tablecloth preserves your table from damages and stain while offering a carefree maintenance feasibility. Just wipe clean using mild soap with damp cloth or sponge on vinyl surface of this tablecloth for best results, which will help it remain attractive and serviceable for a long time. Laundering and ironing is not recommended. This premium-quality robust and reusable tablecloth covers worn and dated tables with spill and waterproof performance and keeps your tabletops free of spills and stains. As a protective layer, slippery and smooth vinyl surface promotes a breeze-like cleaning and a crisp look. All these exclusive features and designs will make this tablecloth the envy of your friends!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eu0OUhI+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ottomanson","source_asin":"B06ZYPV799","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZYPV799","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZYPV799","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
