window.products.push({"id":1155848,"name":"BALLARINI Parma by HENCKELS 10-inch Nonstick Fry Pan, Made in Italy, Durable and Easy to clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r9AFGxO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in Italy, Ballarini infuses the rich tradition of Italian cuisine into easy-to-use pans for everyday cooking. The Parma 10\" Aluminum Nonstick Fry Pan is the go-to pan for perfect frying and even browning. The revolutionary speckled Granitium nonstick coating boasts quick release for effortless eggs. Appealing to the eye, this ultra durable coating has a heart of stone - it is fork-proof, metal-safe and extremely scratch-resistant, increasing the lifespan of your pan. The easy-to-clean surface ensures that no time is wasted on washing and more time can be spent on cooking. Ballarini's innovative Thermopoint heat-sensitive handle turns red when hot and green when cool. This lets you know when the pan's temperature is just right for cooking - preventing unnecessary overheating or undercooking - and properly cooled off for cleaning. Made from the most pure aluminum in the industry, the fry pan's cold forged body heats up rapidly and evenly with no hot spots. Three times more energy efficient than cast iron, aluminum is also wonderfully light, eliminating any arm strain. The ergonomic, stay cool handle offers a comfortable grip for maximum control. With Ballarini, experience the ease of nonstick expertise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r9AFGxO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALLARINI","source_asin":"B0C3F1WN54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3F1WN54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3F1WN54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1155849,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 23Kpa 200W Brushless Stick Vacuum with 3 Suction Mode, Up to 40 Mins Runtime 2200 Rechargeable Batt, 6-in-1 Lightweight Vacuu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610UIIQhC3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wnkim S700 is a 6-in-1 cordless stick handheld cordless vacuum. It features 23KPa powerful suction with 200W advanced digital motor and upgraded filtration system. It comes with a motorized cleaner head, a brush tool and a long crevice to meet your various cleaning needs on the low-med pile carpet, hard floor, trunk, car seat, sofa’s gap, desk, drawer, curtain, ceiling, and bookshelf, etc. Extra Long Runtime Contains 6 cells with 2200mAh battery capacity each, which enables S700 has a longer runtime (15-40mins) than most common cordless vacs do, and also supports the strong power of the motor. Three Strong Suction Modes The MAX mode has 23000Pa suction power, which is strong enough for S700 to pick up pet hair and large particles like dog food; the middle and standard mode has 13000Pa/8000pa suction power, which is also powerful for S700 to pick up fine debris like dirt or crumbs. Maneuverable Brush Head The flexible joint of the brush head lets you feel relaxed when using S700 to move back and forth, whether on hard floors or lone-mid pile carpet or rug; the bright LED lights on the front can help you quickly find out the debris in the dark. One Button Empty | Easy to storage You could press the button to quickly empty the dustbin, and then take out the high-efficiency filter and stainless strainer to wash them.you can stand it independently by the wall or wall mount in the corner and charges the machine. What You Get 1x Main motor with dustbin, 1x Detachable Battery, 1x Retractable metal tube, 1x Wall bracket with screws, 1x LED Motorized cleaner head, 1x Extra filters, 1x Cleaning gadget, 1x Long Suceur Plat, 1x Suceur Plat, 1x Power Adapter, 1x user manual, 1x Quick-start guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610UIIQhC3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wnkim","source_asin":"B09NNC4L1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNC4L1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNC4L1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
