window.products.push({"id":1155868,"name":"Value Arts Handmade Cloisonne Pink Flying Pig Hanging Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sX2q9QSBL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"When pig fly. Yes. The handmade cloisonne pink flying pig do come to your Christmas ornament collections. The brilliant color and superb workmanship makes it collectible. Ideal for Christmas ornament exchange and family members and friends to share. It is handcrafted filigree wire, glazed enamel over copper, fired in high temperature (800°C.). Enamels commonly shrink after firing, and the process is repeated several times to fill in the designs. and they are then 22K gilded. Labor intensive, Utilizing a centuries-old technique to embrace modern arts. It measures 4\"x 3.5\". Gift boxed. The shipping weight is 8 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sX2q9QSBL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Value Arts","source_asin":"B0B25XYMXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B25XYMXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B25XYMXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
